<title>TUNISIA: GADDAFI SAYS GAS PIPELINE TO LINK LIBYA TO TUNISIA.</title>
<headline>GADDAFI SAYS GAS PIPELINE TO LINK LIBYA TO TUNISIA.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian and Libyan heads of states have agreed to establish a gas pipeline which would carry Libyan gas to Tunisia, officials of the two countries said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Libya will build a gazoduc (gas pipeline) which will supply Tunisia for all its needs in gas,&quot; Libyan leader Muammar Gaddafi told a news conference in Tunis at the end of a five-day visit.</p>
<p>Tunisian officials confirmed the agreement, but gave no details.</p>
</text>
